From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] gridcraft-web: host bridge gets a read-only open, opened, requestSave, a save acknowledgement and canDownload/canPrint

docs/phase5/r6.md (owner 2026-11-08: xlsx, pptx and pdf edit through the document server). The host bridge gets what the
Docs bridge has (wordcraft 0127/0128): gridcraft:open {readOnly, canDownload, canPrint} (an edit of a read-only workbook is
taken back at once with a message and nothing is sent), gridcraft:opened, gridcraft:requestSave, and gridcraft:saved {ok}
(the workbook stays unsaved until the parent acknowledged every save; ok:false marks it unsaved again). The opened file
replaces the workbooks shown. Only the .xlsx goes to the parent; exports download in the browser, or are refused with
canDownload:false; Print is refused with canPrint:false. Two new UI strings (xtask i18n OWN_R6).
---

